Third-party brand marks

src/lib/brand-glyphs.generated.ts contains SVG path data for the brand marks the
console draws, fetched by scripts/gen-brand-icons.ts from:

  Simple Icons      https://simpleicons.org            CC0 1.0 Universal
  Font Awesome Free https://fontawesome.com/license    icons under CC BY 4.0
  @lobehub/icons    https://icons.lobehub.com          MIT

The marks themselves are the trademarks of their respective owners and are used
to identify those products. Their inclusion implies no affiliation with or
endorsement by them.

Fonts

Inter, Bricolage Grotesque and Geist Mono are served from src/app/fonts/ under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1; OFL.txt beside them carries the licence and each
family's copyright notice.

Packages

Every npm package in this image keeps its own licence file under
/app/licenses/node_modules/<name>/. A package that publishes none has a NOTICE
there naming its licence and the copyright holders its package.json declares.
The index of every component and its licence is THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the
repository.
